  "desc": "## Tavelo Grow\n\n**TAVELO GROW COMPLETE BIKE**\n\nOne Bike for Every Surface | Violet Surge | Sizes S, XL and XXL Available\n\nThe Tavelo Grow is a carbon gravel platform built around a balanced mix of low weight, aerodynamics, control and comfort. From fast gravel racing to rough mixed-terrain rides and long adventure days, the Grow is designed to be the one bike that does it all, and it arrives ready to ride in the striking Violet Surge colourway.\n\nAt its heart is the UCI-approved Grow carbon frame: a modern 1x-specific design with a threaded BSA bottom bracket, UDH derailleur hanger, generous tyre clearance and an integrated FIDLOCK storage box for tools and ride essentials.\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **Sizes Available:** S, XL and XXL\n- **Frame:** UCI-approved Grow carbon gravel frame, 1x-specific design\n- **Groupset:** Shimano GRX RX717, 1x 12-speed\n- **Handlebar:** Avro GR integrated gravel handlebar\n- **Wheels:** Pertual Sharp GR carbon, steel spokes\n- **Tyres:** Michelin Adventure TLR\n- **Saddle:** Selle Italia Model X\n- **Bar tape:** Selle Italia\n- **Bottom bracket:** Threaded BSA\n- **Derailleur hanger:** UDH\n- **Drivetrain:** 1x only, max 50T chainring (47.5mm chainline)\n- **Max tyre clearance:** 700x55C front, 700x50C rear\n- **Storage:** Integrated box with FIDLOCK mounting system\n- **Condition:** Fully inspected and ready to ride\n\n## MKP Recommends\n\nThe Grow is a genuine do-it-all gravel platform, with huge 55mm tyre clearance, integrated FIDLOCK storage, and a UCI-approved carbon frame that handles fast gravel racing, rough mixed terrain, and long adventure days alike. Worth knowing the threaded BSA bottom bracket and UDH hanger make it quiet, reliable, and easy to service with future drivetrain compatibility, so a buyer gets a fast, race-legal gravel bike with carbon wheels and integrated storage already fitted at a fraction of what the big brands charge for comparable spec.",
