  "tagline": "The Tavelo ARDEN is a modern all-round road frameset engineered for riders who demand speed across every terrain.",
  "desc": "## Arden Race Version - Pop Silver - S\n\n**Tavelo ARDEN Road Frameset**\n\nLightweight. Aerodynamic. Built to Race.\n\nThe Tavelo ARDEN is a modern all-round road frameset engineered for riders who demand speed across every terrain. Combining aerodynamic tube profiles with an exceptionally lightweight carbon construction, the ARDEN is designed to excel on climbs, fast group rides, breakaways and rough road surfaces without compromising comfort or handling.\n\nWhether you’re racing, training or chasing personal bests, the ARDEN delivers the perfect balance of efficiency, responsiveness and long-distance ride quality.\n\nKey Features\n\nUltra-lightweight Toray carbon construction\n\nAerodynamic tube shaping for improved speed\n\nStable and confident handling at high speeds\n\nComfortable enough for long endurance rides\n\nElectronic groupset compatible\n\nThreaded BSA bottom bracket for maximum reliability\n\nFully integrated cable routing\n\nFlat-mount disc brake design\n\nUDH (Universal Derailleur Hanger) compatible\n\nClearance for modern wide tyres\n\nCarbon Options\n\nARDEN Race\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **Carbon:** Toray T800 + M40\n- **Frame Weight:** 780g (Size 500mm)\n- **Carbon:** Toray T1100 + T800 + M46X\n- **Frame Weight:** 680g (Size 500mm)\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\nIdeal for riders looking for an exceptional balance of weight, stiffness and value.\n\nARDEN SL\n\nBuilt using premium high-modulus carbon fibres for riders chasing the lightest possible climbing and race machine.\n\nFrame Specifications\n\nSpecification\n\nDetails\n\nFrame Material\n\nToray Carbon Fibre\n\nBottom Bracket\n\nThreaded BSA (68mm)\n\nBrake Mount\n\nFlat Mount Disc\n\nFront Axle\n\n12 × 100mm Thru-Axle\n\nRear Axle\n\n12 × 142mm Thru-Axle\n\nDerailleur Hanger\n\nUDH Compatible\n\nCable Routing\n\nFully Internal\n\nGroupset Compatibility\n\nElectronic Shifting Only\n\nSeatpost\n\nProprietary Carbon Seatpost\n\nSeatpost Offset\n\n0mm / 15mm Options\n\nHeadset\n\nIntegrated (32.8–41.8mm upper / 34.1–46.9mm lower)\n\nIncluded\n\nCarbon Frameset\n\nCarbon Fork\n\nCarbon Seatpost\n\nHeadset\n\nFront & Rear Thru Axles\n\nWeights\n\nComponent\n\nWeight\n\nARDEN Race Frame\n\n780g\n\nARDEN SL Frame\n\n680g\n\nCarbon Fork\n\n355g\n\nCarbon Seatpost\n\n115g\n\nWeights are based on a 500mm frame and exclude paint and accessories.\n\nTyre Clearance\n\n2x Drivetrain: Up to 34mm tyres\n\n1x Drivetrain: Up to 38mm tyres\n\nPerfect for today’s wider road tyres, offering greater comfort, grip and rolling efficiency.\n\nDesigned for Real-World Speed\n\nThe ARDEN isn’t just designed to be light—it has been engineered to be fast where it matters most. Aerodynamic shaping reduces drag, while carefully tuned frame stiffness provides instant power transfer without sacrificing ride comfort. The result is a race bike that feels equally at home attacking climbs, sprinting from the bunch or spending long days in the saddle.\n\nWhy You’ll Love the ARDEN\n\n– Incredibly lightweight (from just 680g)\n– Aerodynamic yet comfortable ride quality\n– Reliable threaded BSA bottom bracket\n– Fully integrated modern cockpit compatibility\n– UDH compatible for future drivetrain support\n– Clearance for today’s wider performance tyres",
