  "desc": "## Tavelo Arow\n\n**TAVELO AROW RACE**\n\nWind-Tunnel Developed Aero Race Bike | Watt Silver | Medium\n\nThe Tavelo Arow is the frame that put the brand on the map, a wind-tunnel developed aero race bike engineered around a single principle: aero is everything. UCI certified and refined through real-world racing with pro feedback, it has earned a reputation as a genuine giant-killer, standing shoulder to shoulder with race bikes costing far more. This build comes in the striking Watt Silver colourway with Shimano Ultegra Di2, the AVRO Rise cockpit, and deep 47/58 carbon wheels.\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **Size:** Medium\n- **Groupset:** Shimano Ultegra Di2, 12-Speed, wireless electronic shifting, hydraulic disc brakes\n- **Frame:** Tavelo Arow Race Carbon, wind-tunnel developed, narrowed streamlined head tube, claimed 820g in size XS, tyre clearance up to 32mm\n- **Fork:** Tavelo Arow Carbon, aero-optimised\n- **Cockpit:** AVRO Rise Integrated Aero Handlebar, internal cable routing\n- **Wheels:** 47/58 Deep Section Carbon\n- **Colourway:** Watt Silver\n- **Certification:** UCI approved, EN ISO 4210 certified\n- **Condition:** Fully inspected and ready to ride\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\nFrameset also available separately in XS and M for $2,360.\n\n## MKP Recommends\n\nThe Arow is the bike that proved a wind-tunnel-developed race frame does not need a four-figure premium to perform. It delivers genuine aero speed, sharp handling, and pro-level stiffness at a fraction of what the big Western brands charge. Paired here with deep 47/58 carbon wheels and Ultegra Di2, it is a pure speed machine, ideal for the rider who wants flat-out aero performance and a bike that turns heads without emptying the bank account.",
