  "desc": "## Tavelo Arden\n\n**Tavelo Arden Race - Next-Generation All-Road Race Bike with SRAM Force AXS and Pertual Sharp Carbon Wheels | XS | Lifetime Warranty**\n\nThe Tavelo Arden is the next evolution of the brand that took the cycling world by storm. Debuted as a prototype at the 2026 Sea Otter Classic, Velo called it potentially the ultimate all-road race bike, a Tarmac with massive tyre clearance. This brand new XS build runs SRAM Force AXS wireless shifting with Pertual Sharp carbon wheels and the AVRO Rise cockpit.\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **Size:** XS\n- **Groupset:** SRAM Force eTap AXS, 12-Speed, wireless electronic shifting, hydraulic disc brakes\n- **Frame:** Tavelo Arden Carbon, claimed 650g in size M, wind-tunnel developed, BSA threaded BB, UDH, tyre clearance up to 38mm\n- **Fork:** Tavelo Arden Carbon, claimed 340g, aero-optimised\n- **Cockpit:** AVRO Rise Integrated Handlebar, internal cable routing\n- **Wheels:** Pertual Sharp Carbon, deep section aero, fast and lightweight\n- **Tyres:** New Pirelli, premium race rubber\n- **Saddle:** New, performance comfort\n- **Warranty:** Lifetime, UCI approved, EN ISO 4210 certified\n- **Condition:** Brand new build, ready to ride\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\nA brand new next-generation all-road race machine with wireless Force AXS shifting and Pertual Sharp carbon wheels, ready to race with a lifetime warranty.",
