  "desc": "## 2027 Giant Propel Advanced Pro 1\n\n**Giant Propel Advanced Pro 1 2027 - Aero Carbon Race Bike with SRAM Rival AXS, Power Meter and SLR Carbon Wheels | Medium**\n\nThe all-new 2027 Propel Advanced Pro is Giant’s most complete aero bike ever, now under 6.8kg with a claimed 18-watt saving over the previous generation. Brand new with full warranty.\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **Size:** Medium\n- **Groupset:** SRAM Rival eTap AXS, 12-Speed, wireless electronic shifting, hydraulic disc brakes\n- **Power Meter:** SRAM Rival, real-time wattage data from day one\n- **Frame:** Giant Advanced-Grade Composite, AeroSystem Shaping, CFD and wind-tunnel developed, tyre clearance up to 32mm\n- **Fork:** Advanced-Grade Composite, D-shaped steerer, internal cable routing\n- **Wheels:** Giant SLR 1 50 Carbon Disc, 50mm deep hookless rims, tubeless ready\n- **Cockpit:** Giant Contact SL Aero integrated handlebar and stem\n- **Seatpost:** Giant Vector Composite, aero profile with added compliance\n- **Brakes:** SRAM Rival Hydraulic Disc\n- **Warranty:** Full Giant warranty, brand new\n- **Condition:** Brand new, ready to ride\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\nA brand new next-generation aero race machine with wireless AXS shifting, power meter, and flagship SLR 1 carbon wheels, ready to race straight out of the box.\n\n## MKP Recommends\n\n🔵 MKP Recommends: The Advanced Pro shares the same frame as the range-topping Advanced SL, so you get the flagship aero platform for far less, with a power meter already fitted. The new 32mm tyre clearance also makes this a genuine all-rounder, letting you run wider rubber for comfort without giving up race speed.",
